LeaseLens local launch reminder
================================

1. Open Terminal and move to the app folder:
   cd "/Users/bossman/Documents/Yale/MGT409/Lectures 2"

2. Install dependencies if needed:
   python3 -m pip install --user -r requirements.txt

3. Launch the dashboard:
   python3 app.py

4. Open this URL in your browser:
   http://127.0.0.1:8050/

5. Stop the website:
   Press Ctrl+C in the Terminal window running the app.

Data source: lease_data.json
